<view class="pad">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="h1">链接状态</view>
    <view style="font-size: 26rpx; color: #555;">
      {{ready ? (loggedIn ? '已登录：' + (deviceName || deviceId) : '已连接未登录') : '未连接设备'}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="h1">套件（勾选后一键运行，全程自动）</view>
    <view>
      <view
        wx:for="{{suites}}"
        wx:key="v"
        class="chip {{selected[item.v] ? 'on' : ''}}"
        data-v="{{item.v}}"
        bindtap="onToggleSuite"
      >{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>
    <view style="margin-top: 12rpx;">
      <text class="chip">循环轮数：</text>
      <text
        wx:for="{{roundChoices}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        class="chip {{rounds === item ? 'on' : ''}}"
        data-v="{{item}}"
        bindtap="onPickRounds"
      >{{item}} 轮</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="h1">环境（自动记忆）</view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="label">goodAp SSID</text>
      <input value="{{goodSsid}}" bindinput="onGoodSsid" placeholder="=设备当前网络（防误改）" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="label">goodAp 口令</text>
      <input
        class="pwdtext"
        password="{{!goodPwdShow}}"
        value="{{goodPassword}}"
        bindinput="onGoodPassword"
        placeholder="当前网络口令"
      />
      <text class="eye" bindtap="onToggleGoodPwd">{{goodPwdShow ? '隐藏' : '显示'}}</text>
    </view>
    <!-- 可见化配套：明文 + 长度/指纹/来源 + 卫生告警。
         口令值设备不回传，唯一自证手段就是"人能看见原文"+"长度/指纹能和上次成功比"。 -->
    <view class="pwdmeta">
      {{goodPwdMeta}}
      <text wx:if="{{goodPwdWarn}}" class="pwdwarn">⚠ {{goodPwdWarn}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="pwdmeta pwdwarn" wx:if="{{lastBadPwd}}">
      上一轮被设备拒绝的口令：「{{lastBadPwd}}」（指纹 {{lastBadPwdFp}}）—— 对照它改，别重复同一个值。
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="label">failAp SSID</text>
      <input value="{{failSsid}}" bindinput="onFailSsid" placeholder="broker 不可达 AP" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="label">failAp 口令</text>
      <input
        password="{{!failPwdShow}}"
        value="{{failPassword}}"
        bindinput="onFailPassword"
        placeholder="如 TQ2018"
      />
      <text class="eye" bindtap="onToggleFailPwd">{{failPwdShow ? '隐藏' : '显示'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view style="font-size: 22rpx; color: #999; margin-top: 8rpx;">
      安全红线：apply 前强制核对 goodAp=设备当前网络，不一致自动中止；failpath 绝不 apply。
    </view>
    <view style="font-size: 22rpx; color: #999; margin-top: 4rpx;">
      口令默认明文显示（本页为取证用测试页；输错时肉眼可辨，不必等 wrong_password）。日志里只打长度+指纹，不打原文。
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn" type="primary" bindtap="onRun" disabled="{{busy}}">▶ 一键运行（{{suites.length}} 套件可选）</button>
  <view wx:if="{{progressText}}" style="text-align:center;color:#1a6dff;font-size:26rpx;">{{progressText}}</view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{logLines.length}}">
    <view style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:12rpx;">
      <view class="h1" style="margin-bottom:0;">运行日志</view>
      <button class="btn" style="margin:0;padding:4rpx 28rpx;font-size:24rpx;line-height:1.8;" bindtap="onCopyLog">复制日志</button>
    </view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y class="log scroll" scroll-into-view="{{scrollTo}}">
      <view id="L{{index}}" wx:for="{{logLines}}" wx:key="index">{{item}}</view>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{results.length}}">
    <view class="h1">结果 <text class="sum">{{summary.pass}}/{{summary.total}}</text></view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y class="scroll">
      <view class="res" wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="id">
        <view>
          <text class="tag {{item.pass ? 'ok' : 'bad'}}">{{item.pass ? 'PASS' : 'FAIL'}}</text>
          <text>[{{item.id}}] {{item.name}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="detail" wx:if="{{item.detail}}">{{item.detail}}</view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>
</view>
